From bdf0f026ca71c08263d6007ea3083856c7561024 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "kevin.krausse" <kkrausse97@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:18:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] gromen-inflate: split the calm take so the debt-to-GDP
 line is spoken

The seven calm lines ran about 47 s as one Orpheus generation and the
model dropped a sentence near the end on every seed; with seed 3 the
proof line lost 'Debt to GDP fell from 130% to 115%' while the caption
and diagram still showed it. Two shorter takes (intro..proof, ai..japan)
speak every line. The second take uses seed 2 because seed 1 swallowed
'Neither'. Wording is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
